// ModelWeave Inference Protocol (mwip), version 1: shared types.
//
// mwip is the protocol between the ModelWeave gateway and inference engines.
// The gateway turns every API request (OpenAI Chat Completions / Responses,
// Anthropic Messages) into the intermediate state defined in this file: the
// conversation rendered into one token list by the model's prompt format,
// with images and videos already planned and expanded, and the options the
// engine needs to generate and to parse its own output.
